# Player_HurtFixed: the fixed $20 hurt taking the player's last life (ruling 5, 2), at its first
# call (TAS f92483, stage 3: a6 = the player object, +$1E its record): health (record +4) $10, so
# it reaches 0, and no lives left (record +6 = 0), so Player_LoseLife puts the player out
# (HUD_PlayerOut) and the native despawns the player. A real state: any player on the last life
# with under $20 health when the hazard hits (the TAS takes this hurt with lives to spare).

case last_life
w [a6 + $1E] + 4 = $10
w [a6 + $1E] + 6 = 0
